WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.879
Speaker 1: as if we don't already have enough
anti-Semitism to deal with right now.

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:10.060
Radical and outrageous right wing Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Green is comparing having

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:14.920
to wear a mask in the House of Representatives
to the Holocaust.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.000
Green was interviewed by the Christian Broadcasting
Networks, David Brody on the Real America's

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.350
Voice TV show.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.010
Yes, that's a real channel.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.500
That's a real show.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.180
Here is what she had to say.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.130
Speaker 2: This woman is mentally ill.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:33.510
You know, we can look back at a time in history
where people were told to wear a gold star

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:39.829
and they were definitely treated like second
class citizens, so much so that they were

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:42.830
put in chains and taken to gas chambers and
Nazi Germany.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:47.200
And this is exactly the type of abuse that
Nancy Pelosi is talking about.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.480
Well, let's talk about the queen of the House
of Hypocrisy.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:55.040
Speaker 1: There was no pushback at all from
the interviewer, David Brody, there.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:04.210
A mask mandate from mentally ill Nancy Pelosi
is like Jews being murdered in the Holocaust,

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.330
according to Marjorie Taylor Green.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.720
Now, of course, there's no follow up from
the reporter because CBN isn't journalism,

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.040
it's merely propaganda.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.180
And the guy really isn't a reporter.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.540
But at the same time, to say nothing is really
not an option.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:25.450
This has to be called out when something fun,
something for the greater good, like vaccination

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:32.700
or wearing a mask during a pandemic is being
compared to the genocide of the Jewish people.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.270
You have to call it out and say this isn't
accurate and anybody who enables it.

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:40.729
In this case, it was David Brody on the Christian
Broadcasting Network enabling.

00:01:40.729 --> 00:01:43.290
It also must be called out.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:48.560
The Nazis didn't order the Jews to do things
that kept them safe.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.900
That wasn't what went on during the Holocaust.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:56.060
Rules established to protect health are not
the same as the systematic extermination of

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.060
a people.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:01.790
And of course, the greater tragedy is that
this woman was elected to be a member of Congress.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:06.560
It's not even clear to me that Marjorie Taylor
Greene should have a driver's license.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:11.989
And there's an entire political movement that
believes she should be one of the five hundred

00:02:11.989 --> 00:02:17.599
and thirty five federal lawmakers, hundred
senators, 435 in the House, 535 total.

00:02:17.599 --> 00:02:22.180
There's a movement that thinks in a country
of three hundred and thirty one million.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:28.879
One of the 535 leading us at the federal level
should be her that is really, really dangerous.

00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:33.510
And this is what happens when we either look
away or we don't vote or we don't vote in

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:34.700
large enough numbers.

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:40.529
I got an email from a viewer who believes
he understands how people like Marjorie Taylor

00:02:40.529 --> 00:02:43.439
Greene come to have a following in the first
place.

00:02:43.439 --> 00:02:49.299
And the way he outlined it was you start with
years and years of fear mongering about You-Know-Who,

00:02:49.299 --> 00:02:50.299
right?

00:02:50.299 --> 00:02:55.000
Years and years and years of fear mongering
about Democrats and minorities taking advantage

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.010
of welfare programs, brown people coming here
illegally and stealing your jobs and committing

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.719
crimes, all of that fear mongering that you
know of.

00:03:04.719 --> 00:03:13.249
You combine it with sensationalist propaganda,
news media, Fox News, OCN, Newsmax, Christian

00:03:13.249 --> 00:03:19.540
Broadcasting Network, and then you have underfunded
education parents who don't know anything

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:25.279
about media literacy so they can't teach their
kids so the kids have no place to learn it.

00:03:25.279 --> 00:03:33.189
And then you direct at the self-centered sort
of upper middle class, middle class suburbanites

00:03:33.189 --> 00:03:36.599
like Green, you direct the propaganda at them.

00:03:36.599 --> 00:03:40.659
Absent the education that they need, they
become deranged.

00:03:40.659 --> 00:03:43.699
They become obsessed with protecting their
own status.

00:03:43.699 --> 00:03:50.010
That's being threatened by, you know, Democrats,
nonexistent socialists, minorities, immigrants,

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.059
poor people, et cetera.

00:03:52.059 --> 00:03:53.919
They identify them as the enemies.

00:03:53.919 --> 00:03:58.600
And then in a country of three hundred and
thirty one million people, imagine this is

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:02.309
who ends up getting elected as one of four
hundred and thirty five members of the House,

00:04:02.309 --> 00:04:05.479
one of five hundred and thirty five members
of the House and Senate.

00:04:05.479 --> 00:04:10.199
It is a vile and disgusting analogy that she
makes.

00:04:10.199 --> 00:04:15.449
She is a vile woman and I know that sometimes
the term mentally ill is used in jest or as

00:04:15.449 --> 00:04:16.500
a slur.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:21.519
But there are more and more members of Congress
referring to Marjorie Taylor Green as sick

00:04:21.519 --> 00:04:26.680
or mentally ill, including AOC, who actually
said, quote, This is a woman that's deeply

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.550
unwell and clearly needs help.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.659
It seems obvious that that's the case.

00:04:30.659 --> 00:04:34.750
Some people saw what AOSIS said and they said,
oh, that's bad.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:38.310
AOC is stigmatizing and making fun of mental
illness.

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.000
I don't see that at all.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:46.009
At a certain point, we have to be able to
say this is not just an ignorant person with

00:04:46.009 --> 00:04:48.180
disgusting political views.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:54.700
These are ignorant political views that have
been weaponized by some kind of mental illness.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:58.270
And you have enough people in this country
who either don't realize that this is an unwell

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.379
woman or they don't care.

00:05:00.379 --> 00:05:01.530
I don't know.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:08.280
It has to be OK to propose that there is a
mental illness component when it's so obviously

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.280
what's going on.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:14.210
But at the same time, the mental illness component
doesn't excuse the political beliefs.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.539
It's a double edged sword.

00:05:15.539 --> 00:05:18.790
Calling something mental illness when it isn't
isn't a good thing to do.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:26.099
At the same time, excusing bad acts because
the person seems sick or unwell.

00:05:26.099 --> 00:05:27.740
We also can't be doing that.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:32.050
It is a complicated issue, particularly in
a country where many don't have access to

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:35.580
proper mental health services or diagnostic
services.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:41.660
And when it's heavily stigmatized and when
quite frankly, I mean, listen, I don't know

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.759
if I'll get in trouble for saying this.

00:05:44.759 --> 00:05:50.750
There are lots of political beliefs, some
on the left, but overwhelmingly on the right

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:54.850
that are delusional beliefs in the literal
sense.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:06:00.620
And so when you when you see that it actually
can be difficult to distinguish just delusional

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:05.590
political beliefs versus someone who is diagnosable.

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.520
I think with Marjorie Taylor Greene, it's
probably both.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:12.080
And that is increasingly what we're hearing
from people who know her and who have been

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:19.810
targeted and by her like Alexandria Cacio
Cortez, let me know your thoughts, but a disgusting

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.740
analogy and comparison there.

